OL,3,GNEWSALoss of some rural hospital
OL,4,Aservices 'temporary'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS bosses have said services withdrawn
OL,7,Ffrom two rural hospitals were only
OL,8,Ftemporary, despite concerns of
OL,9,F"neglect" in the region.
OL,11,FEndoscopy services were moved from
OL,12,FNorth Cambridgeshire Hospital in
OL,13,FWisbech to King's Lynn in Norfolk after
OL,14,F"serious concerns" were flagged.
OL,16,FHealth chiefs said the decision was
OL,17,Fmade "on the grounds of patient
OL,18,Fsafety".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
