OL,3,GNEWSALoss of some rural hospital
OL,4,Aservices 'temporary'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDoddington Hospital has seen breast
OL,7,Fsurgery, dermatology and ear, nose and
OL,8,Fthroat (ENT) clinics withdrawn or
OL,9,Ftemporarily suspended due to staffing
OL,10,Fissues.
